      "message": "This will only be used on Zephyr EC boards.\n\nThis entire file should be moved to platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/imvp/ and the updated to follow the Zephyr driver model.\n\nYou can then set the I2C port and target address using a node in the devicetree instead of hard coding `I2C_PORT_IMVP` and `I2C_ADDR_IMVP`.\n\nAlso use the Zephyr native API `i2c_transfer_dt` instead of the legacy EC versions.",
      "range": {
